(AEC guidance states the *Electoral Legislation Amendment \(Electoral Reform\) Act 2025* is a major) Tj
T* (overhaul, with changes commencing from **1 July 2026**, including:) Tj
T* (- lower disclosure threshold \(AEC fact sheets indicate $5,000, indexed after general elections\)) Tj
T* (- expedited/near-real-time donation disclosure during election periods) Tj
T* (- revised annual/election return arrangements) Tj
T* (- revised publication and compliance settings.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Because transitional arrangements and subordinate instruments matter, users should verify operative) Tj
T* (dates and instruments on the Federal Register and AEC reform pages before relying on a specific) Tj
T* (obligation.) Tj
